window.products.push({"id":414043,"name":"annadaif Plush Shaggy Duvet Cover,Black Fluffy Comforter Cover Set Full Size, Fuzzy Faux Fur Bedding Set with Zipper Closure, Luxury Ultra Soft 3 Piec","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/915IqjcDl9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[ What Can You Get ] Full: 1 Duvet cover (80\" x 90\") and 2 pillowcases(20\" x 26\") with envelope closure. ***Note: Comforter or duvet insert, pillow insert not included! [ High-quality Material ] The front of the duvet cover is made of 100-percent polyester microfiber and the back is ultra soft crystal velvet fabric. It brings stunning touch of glam and luxurious for your bedroom/guest room decor. Furry duvet cover set can be sent as a great gift for boys, girls, and lovers. [ Ultra Soft & Luxurious ] Annadaif Faux fur duvet cover is made of 100% polyester material. Gorgeous 45mm long fur can be fixed very well and do not slip. It resists fading, wrinkles and pilling, and also provides the best warmth and air permeability. [ Hidden Zipper & Corner Ties ] The design of hidden zipper is easy to separate and wash, more durable and more convenient, and also noiseless. The four corner ties ensure that your comforter remains in right place rather than gathering into a ball. The closure zipper makes it easy for you to insert and remove the duvet. [ Please Note Before Use ] The duvet cover will be delivered in a vacuum bag to you. It is inevitable that long time transportation will bring it a slight unpleasant smell. Recommended that you wash it before use: Please turn the plush side inside to protect the plush. Machine wash with the cold water cycle and tumble dry at low temperature to make it fluffy again. Do not bleach! Do not Iron! Contact us if you have any questions, we will get back to you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/915IqjcDl9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"annadaif","source_asin":"B09G32JVPW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-414043","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09G32JVPW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09G32JVPW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":414044,"name":"UOMAX LED Gaming Chair Light Computer Chairs with Ergonomic Mesh Back Support. Flatten Widen Seat Cushion Reclining Office Chair, Adjustable PC Gamer ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cM6vQ48+L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"【Awesome LED Lights】: Features with LED lighting on the back of the chair to match your gaming gears. It can be connected to a computer USB port or a USB charging port. Very easy to use, you can choose your favorite color of the LED gaming chair to match the color of your keyboard lighting. 【Breathable Mesh Fabric Back】Featuring elastic mesh fabric allows air flow, keeping away the heat and humidity close to the body. The strong tensile strength ensures the use age of the chair. The distinctive back is designed by diamond cut style with high strength and high toughness materials. 【Excellent Component】: The racing gaming chair equipped with SGS certificated gas lift makes height adjustments quick and easy from 15.52\" to 22.24\". PU leather tested to be skin friendly, durable and water-resistant. BIFMA Certificated ABS five-star base can support up to 250 lbs. 【Ergonomics】: High-back & headrest offer adequate support to neck and head, an extra adjustable lumbar support and wider seat area are designed to offer gamers the utmost comfort in ergonomic sitting position, ensuring long time sitting. 【Multi-function】: 360 degree swivel offers freedom of movement in any direction. 90°-135° reclining function, could be locked in place and stay reclined at certain angles for working, gaming, reading or napping. Padded linkage armrests moves with the back as chair reclines. Smooth racing caster wheels help the chair glide effortlessly with no worry about scratching floors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cM6vQ48+L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UOMAX","source_asin":"B07PB873FD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-414044","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PB873FD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PB873FD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
