window.products.push({"id":414057,"name":"ITAX-WORLD Automatic Soap Dispenser Touchless Soap Dispenser Wall Mount 500ml/16.9oz Battery Operated Electric Hand Sanitizer Dispenser for Commercial","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.86,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51++wFXcxuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Touchless Soap Dispenser Wall Mounted】Our automatic soap dispenser touchless is made of high-strength ABS material, sturdy and durable. Adopted the precise infrared motion and PIR sensor detection technology, it can dispense 1ml soap liquid instantly without touch, creating a more hygienic way to wash your hands. 【High Capacity & Easy Refilling】This automatic soap dispenser has a large capacity of 16.9oz/500ml, saving you from the hassle of constant refills. Designed with a wide opening mouth, it's super fast and convenient for you to refill this commercial soap dispenser with most all-purpose liquid gel soap, hand sanitizer, dish soap, and so on. 【Longlasting & Energy Efficient 】The wall mount soap dispenser is powered by 4 pcs AA alkaline batteries (not included), which will allow you to enjoy hands-free soap dispensing for up to a year before having to change batteries, not over consume battery. Perfect for bathrooms, kitchens, hotel, restaurant, office, schools. 【Space Saving Wall Mounted Style】Our wall soap dispenser is easy to mount on any wall with screws set or glue,which helps to save countertop space and keep ypur space clean and organized . A hygienic solution to all the clutter of bottles on your shower floor, shower shelf, kitchen sink, washing basin. 【Anti-leakage Design】The non-drip spout and IPX5 waterproof case of the touchless soap dispenser makes it easy to clean and prevent mess and waste. The transparent soap compartment lets you know when it’s time to refill. ✔️100% SATISFACTION SERVICE: Get this bathroom soap dispenser to keep your bathrooms & kitchens organized! Guaranteed by 90-DAY MONEY BACK and 1-Year warranty. Please don't hesitate to contact us whenever you have any concerns about this wall mount dispenser set, we will offer a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51++wFXcxuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ITAX-WORLD","source_asin":"B0BS133S67","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-414057","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS133S67","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS133S67","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
