window.products.push({"id":414117,"name":"JOSTYLE 6.5FT Pre-Lit Snow Flocked Christmas Tree, Artificial Christmas Tree with 400 UL-Certified LED Lights and 1100 Branch Tips for Indoor Outdoor ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71B-x0ziKTL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【Snow Flocked Design】This Christmas tree is designed with flocking. The snow-white branches and warm white UL lights create a festive atmosphere. This beautiful christmas tree can make your home more festive and let your family enjoy the holiday. 【UL Certificated Pre-lit LED Design】This tree is equipped with 300 LED lights for 6FT, 400 for 6.5FT, 500 for 7.5FT and 650 for 9FT. These small LED bulbs are evenly distributed on each branch, which can make our Christmas tree emit warm and soft white light. All LED light bulbs have passed UL's safety certification to ensure their durability and safety. 【Great Value for Money】This Christmas tree comes with a perfect set of decorations.They are a good addition to the Christmas tree, they not only can be hung on the Christmas tree, on the wall, on the fireplace or on the window, increase the festive atmosphere, but also bring good luck and happiness to the family. 【Sturdy Metal Base】Compared with other cheap plastic base, our reinforced metal base will provide the tree with greater support and ensure good stability. Foldable stand with 2' diameter can prevent the tree from tilting or falling. And non-slip foot pads can protect the floor from scratches. Warning: Please remove the plastic cap which is useless before installation. If damaged or missing when received, not impact any usage effect. 【Simple Setup and Storage】 Put the tree together in just 3 steps, easy to disassemble and store. And the hinged branches will expand easier to save your time and energy. Just arrange it a little, hang the decorations, and a beautiful Christmas tree is finished. 【Full & Natural Appearance】Presents a perfect and Natural appearance, this snow flocked Christmas tree has 1100 tips for 6FT, 1600 tips for 7.5FT and 2400 tips for 9FT which is leafy and fluffy without gaps. Simple green color and high-quality PVC make it look real and beautiful. 【Fast Delivery & 5 Year Warranty 】Receive SOON .Ship from 13 U.S. based warehouses. All of our products come with a limited 5 year warranty. 40\"(Dia) x 72\"(H) for 6FT, 45\"(Dia) x 84\"(H) for 7FT , 52\"(Dia) x 90\"(H) for 7.5FT , 59\"(Dia) x 108\"(H) for 9FT.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71B-x0ziKTL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOSTYLE","source_asin":"B09KBQ46M1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-414117","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KBQ46M1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KBQ46M1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
