window.products.push({"id":414134,"name":"Vertical Spice - 22x1.5x11 DC - Spice Rack for Cabinet Storage - 2 Drawers - 2 Tiers - Easy Install - Size: 4.6\" Width x 9.25\" Height x 10.6\" Depth - ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":96.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KIFbaJ3OS._AC_SL1246_.jpg","description":"MOST SPICES IN THE SMALLEST SPACE – STURDY AND QUALITY MADE IN THE USA - Organizes 10 regular (2” diameter x 5” tall) jars on the lower shelves and 10 half-sized spice jars on the upper shelves. Many spices in a small space, bringing the back row easily to the front for you. 2 INDIVIDUAL SMOOTH SLIDING, FULL EXTENSION DRAWERS - 2.10\" wide x 10.05\" long drawers glide on a chrome steel ball-bearing slides. The fronts and backs are clear acrylic (Plexiglas). The drawers and base are Starboard HDPE for long life and easy clean-up. STACK 1/2 SIZED SPICE JARS TOO - Flex-Side bands strategically located to contain the lower and upper half-jars. - VERY SIMPLE INSTALL - A screwdriver is the only tool. Arrives assembled and includes mounting screws. PATENTED FLEX-SIDES - NO ONE ELSE has our flexible mini-bungie cord sides. All containers held in place. Easy On/Off of all spice jars and containers. Adaptive sides allow over-sized containers. NO WASTED SPACE – If the container fits between the shelves, you can easily fit and access it. Bands are long-lasting and easy to replace. LIFETIME SOLUTION - You take care of the cooking, our unmatched, quality-built spice rack will help organize and handle your spices. YOU DESERVE THE BEST, THIS IS USA MADE CRAFTMANSHIP - This Is the ORIGINAL SPICE RACK DRAWER, imitated but not duplicated. Communicate directly with helpful Vertical Spice company personnel. FULLY ASSEMBLED - SIZE: 10.60\" deep x 4.6\" wide x 9.25\" tall. DEPTH = back of the cabinet to inside the closed door. WIDTH = between the hinges. HEIGHT = needs 9.5\" tall space for 1/2 height spice jars on the top tier. All Vertical Spice units can be mounted directly side-by-side or separately. Units mount through the base and can be mounted on any shelf, with or without a face frame.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KIFbaJ3OS._AC_SL1246_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vertical Spice","source_asin":"B00F4N0V3Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-414134","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00F4N0V3Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00F4N0V3Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
