window.products.push({"id":414136,"name":"Sandusky Lee BM30361852-05 Dove Gray Steel Mobile Book Case, 3 Adjustable Shelves, 58\" Height x 36\" Width x 18\" Depth","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612Rs5eGF2L._SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Sandusky Lee BM30361852-05 dove-gray mobile bookcase is made of welded steel for strength and has three adjustable shelves and swivel casters, and it is suitable for organizing, storing, and transporting books, reference materials, binders, and other office materials. The shelves adjust in 1\" increments to accommodate the height of the books and other materials. The bottom surface on this mobile bookcase is raised and level with the front lip for ergonomic purposes and it can be used as a fourth shelf. This bookcase has four 6\" swivel casters with locking brakes on two of the casters for maneuverability and safe handling. The caster wheels have 5\" diameters and are 1-1/4\" wide, and the wheels are made of polypropylene to resist high temperatures, corrosion, and wear. This bookcase has a dove-gray powder coat finish to resist chipping and corrosion. The assembled bookcase, with casters, measures 58 x 36 x 18 inches (H x W x D). (H is height, the vertical distance from lowest to highest point; W is width, the horizontal distance from left to right; D is depth, the horizontal distance from front to back.) The bookcase has a 200 lb. per shelf capacity. It complies with American National Standards Institute/Business and Institutional Furniture Manufacturers Association (ANSI/BIFMA) shelf standards. This bookcase requires some assembly, instructions and hardware are included. Tools for assembly are sold separately. Standing shelf units are commonly used to store items to help create organized, efficient, and safer work areas. These systems typically consist of a frame or rack with open shelves. Added components such as casters, wheels, or handles are used for applications that require mobility. Standing shelf units are used in a variety of office, industrial, educational, and residential settings. Sandusky Lee manufactures steel storage products for office, commercial, industrial, and educational applications. The company is headquartered in Littlestown, PA. What's in the Box? Bookcase with three adjustable shelves Bookcase with three adjustable shelves (4) Casters with wheels (4) Casters with wheels Hardware for caster assembly Hardware for caster assembly Instructions for caster assembly Instructions for caster assembly","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612Rs5eGF2L._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sandusky","source_asin":"B005VQRBQO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-414136","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005VQRBQO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005VQRBQO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
