window.products.push({"id":414204,"name":"Wereves 24 Pcs Sunset Tulips Artificial Flowers Real Touch Faux Tulips Realistic Flowers DIY Bridal Bouquet Wedding Party Home Table Centerpiece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ws4jL1cGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High Quality Material】Our tulips flowers head are made of eco-friendly and healthy PU, soft and true to the touch. The stem is made of plastic and middle contains iron wires, flexible and bendable, You can easily bend or cut them short to DIY any of decorations you like. 【Package&Size】Each pack contains 24 Pcs sunset tulips artificial flowers. Tulip total height: 13.39 inches/34 cm, Stem: 11.42 inches/29 cm. Flower head length: 2 inches/5 cm; the diameter: 1.38 inches/3.5cm.These lifelike artificial tulip flowers will stay fresh forever. 【Easy to Maintain】Unlike real tulips that fade and lose their petals, these fake tulips are easy to care for, easy to clean, durable and never wither for a long time. Artificial tulips are safe for children, pets and people with pollen allergies, making them the perfect choice. 【Real Touch Flowers】Faux tulips features high quality material, vivid petal veins, bright colors, realistic touch flower heads and leaves,looks real-like.Real touch tulips can bring your loved one an unforgettable surprise and a more romantic atmosphere on the anniversary. 【Best Wonderful Decoration】Tulips represent blessing, love and purity, which making a great gift for your family, friends and loved ones.Our artificial tulips bouquet also perfect for home, garden, bedroom, living room, kitchen, porch, office, hotel, cafe, store, table decoration . Single stem tulips can create a romantic atmosphere for weddings, party, Valentine's Day, engagements, various anniversaries, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ws4jL1cGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wereves","source_asin":"B09M6XGFL3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-414204","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09M6XGFL3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09M6XGFL3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":414205,"name":"Panda Palm Round Placemats Set of 4 Braided Cotton Table Mats Heat Resistant for Dinner Parties Thanksgiving Christmas Birthdays and Daily Use (Orange","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zzLUZ5SfL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Welcome Panda Palm! When you eat regularly, the desktop will be a mess. Fortunately, there is now a Panda Palm placemat that will protect your table or bar from the wear and tear of tableware! Not only do they protect tabletops anywhere they're put, but they're also stylish and seasonal, doubling as eye-catching kitchen or dining table decorations! They look more luxurious and more comfortable to use. I believe that the Panda Palm placemat is an integral part of your table. More than just a placemat for the kitchen! - Comfortable – Imitation cotton and linen material, soft and comfortable, foldable without any trace - Breathable&Hypoallergenic – Our placemats are woven, have good breathability, and are environmentally friendly materials. They are the gospel of allergic people. - Both indoors and outdoors Suitable for, but not limited to, restaurants, cafes, desks, living rooms, coffee tables, etc. Even you can use it in the drawer of the table. - Gifts - Great gift idea for all occasions, Christmas, Wedding, Fathers Day, Mothers Day, Valentines, Thanksgiving. Precautions Can be rolled up to save space when not in use 1、Wash with warm water and a mild detergent. It can be cleaned with a soft brush. 2、If you accidentally leave the sauce such as ketchup on the placemat, first wipe it with a paper towel and rinse it out after use. 3、If the placemat has creases, soak it in warm water (40~50°C) for 10 to 15 minutes, remove it, and lay it on the table. If necessary, place a heavy object on the placemat for half an hour.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zzLUZ5SfL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Panda Palm","source_asin":"B0C58K77P2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-414205","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C58K77P2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C58K77P2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
