window.products.push({"id":414232,"name":"6L Humidifiers for Large Room, Mist Humidifiers for Bedroom Top Fill Humidifier with Essential Oil Diffuser, 360° Rotation Nozzle, 3 Mist Levels Lasts","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51p-fpnDjZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"6L Humidifiers For Bedroom --- 6L/1.6 gallon extra-large water tank ensures up to 45 hours continuous working time, which is perfect for bedroom, baby room, office, and so on. Ultra-quiet at 23 decibels, no annoying working sound. Our cool mist humidifier should be a great choice for light sleep person and who have kids, pets. Quiet & Long Lasting Mist Output --- 3 adjustable long lasting mist levels(Low/Medium/High), you can enjoy the option to change the mist setting and timer setting. The humidifiers can be automatically auto-off with red indicator light flashing when it is out of water or remove the tank away. 1-12 hours timer setting is more convenient for your use. Top Fill Humidifier Easy To Clean --- KONFORSMAR top-fill humidifier is incredibly convenient to refill and clean than traditional humidifiers. It's features a detachable water tank with a secure built-in handle and an extra wide opening for easy filling and clean the inside of the tank. Built-in advanced water level sensor, auto shut off when water is running out, preventing damage to the humidifier and ensure your safety. Easy To Use With Voice Control --- KONFORSMAR cool mist humidifier can be simply connect with the APP through 2.4GHz Wi-Fi for remote control. It features schedules to automatically turn on/off the humidifier as your schedule, which lets you enjoy a comfortable space. Before running setup, please allow all applications for mobile phone function permissions. Humidifiers With Essential Oil Tray --- Equipped with replaceable ceramic filter to purifies can keeps the water fresh & prevents odour. And our humidifiers comes with a essential oil tray that you add some favorite essential oils to the tray before turning on the humidifier, and you will enjoy a unique and relaxing aromatherapy experience! Please DO NOT add essential oil directly to the water tank, avoid damaging the machine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51p-fpnDjZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"K KONFORSMART","source_asin":"B0BN2WY3ZH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-414232","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN2WY3ZH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN2WY3ZH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
