window.products.push({"id":414309,"name":"Flarify Pampas Grass | 48 Inches | 6 Stems | Large Artificial Faux Pampas | Perfect for Fake Pampas Grass Wedding Flower Arrangements, Boho Home Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SResq5bPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Give Your Living Space A Brilliant and Beautiful Update! Flarify is proud to offer top of the line large faux pampas! Pampas grass is a beautiful way to decorate your home or event with a chic boho touch! Artificial pampas portray the same look as natural pampas grass but it offers durability for multiple events or just longer-lasting in home decor, best part, no shedding! Your living room should be a safe space from the wild world outside. Adding some artificial grass could set your meditative room into Nirvana. ADD TEXTURE & WARMTH! Simply drop our pampas grass in a large floor vase, glass jar, ceramic pot or terracotta vase! Great to pair with raffia chairs, baskets, and jute rugs. The ways to decorate and DIY with it are limitless! DIY A WREATH: Wreaths aren't just for Christmastime. They add pizzazz to your door all year round — and a pampas grass wreath is a lovely way to celebrate the end of summer and beginning of autumn, Requiring only a metal frame and plenty of pampas grass. Hung on a plain white door, the DIY adds a touch of elegance to your entryway. Colors ; White pampas grass, Natural pampas grass, Dusty Rose / pink pampas grass. Check out all our colors and sizes! GET READY TO BECOME A FAN :We know you are doing a big deal, and we will only provide you with the most exceptional product and service around or your money back! Add our pampas grass large to your cart and experience our outstanding customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SResq5bPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Event Decor Direct","source_asin":"B08MWP8RRH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-414309","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MWP8RRH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MWP8RRH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":414310,"name":"Totally Bamboo Colors Non-Skid Cutting Board, 15-Inch, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.33,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91n2NWESCIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Totally Bamboo Colors Non-Skid Cutting Board features a colored, silicone layer on either end that prevents the board from skidding along your counter and makes for an easy and functional prepping and cooking experience. The board's bright colored silicone features not only make for easy use, but they also add a fun and vibrant touch to any kitchen. The board measures 15-1/2 by 11-3/4-Inch and is only 5/8-inch thick, making it maneuverable and easy to store. Wash by hand with warm water and occasionally use Totally Bamboo's Revitalizing Oil to extend life and beauty of your board. From the original bamboo cutting board company, Totally Bamboo, this cutting board is a beautiful and functional addition to any kitchen. Bamboo is the natural alternative for all things wood. It is the fastest growing plant on our planet and does not require any special care to grow. In fact, it is a grass that produces more oxygen than a hard wood forest of comparable size, it helps to reduce carbon dioxide gases blamed for global warming and it helps to prevent soil erosion through its widespread root system and large canopy. At Totally Bamboo, we are proud to say we use only the highest quality bamboo, harvested at the optimum age of 5 years from our own bamboo forests. There are over 1200 species of bamboo; however, we choose to use \"Moso\" timber bamboo for its strength, density and versatility. As an added bonus, it is not a habitat for pandas. Our factories adhere to a very stringent protocol for curing and processing the bamboo, ensuring the highest quality product. We take steps to ensure that our employees are well taken care of and work in a safe and hazard free environment. Our goal is continuous improvement through design, developing new, unique and innovative products which appeal to the environmentally conscious.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91n2NWESCIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Totally Bamboo","source_asin":"B00CGALWFY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-414310","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CGALWFY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CGALWFY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
