window.products.push({"id":414613,"name":"CookinGadgets Manual Coffee Grinder & Pour Over Dripper | Adjustable Conical Ceramic Burr Mill for Precision Brewing | Paperless Reusable Drip Filter ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510p4VjcJDL._AC_.jpg","description":"★ADVANCED CONSTRUCTION: Carefully constructed to be portable, durable, and convenient, this grinder will produce the perfect grind, creating that deliciously smooth cup of coffee you have been searching for! This is not some cheap blade grinder that can be easily found in any local stores, it uses only the best quality materials. No, this is a SUPERIOR CERAMIC BURR GRINDER that will grind coffee beans consistently into fine grains every time. Note, the GLASS COFFEE CUP is NOT INCLUDED. ★PERFECT TASTE: Included with the grinder is a slick STAINLESS STEEL COFFEE DRIPPER which guarantees you will taste the difference in your dark beverage like no other. How, you ask?! Due to the stainless steel design, the water never touches any plastic or paper, thus preventing any coffee to be tainted by that artificial plastic and paper taste. The type of filter used when brewing coffee does matter! ★HEALTHY & ECONOMICAL, (win-win situation!): The paperless dripper is an innovative, reusable, and clean alternative brewing method. A dual-mesh stainless steel design keeps the coffee grounds in the filter, giving you a cup of coffee with more flavor and aroma than you have been settling for. You will never have to worry about chemicals from plastic parts getting into your body. No more buying paper filters or killing unnecessary natural resources, and a healthier drinking option for you! ★TRAVEL FRIENDLY: Do you dream of backpacking through Europe? Drinking fresh coffee while camping? How about just wishing for a CLEAN coffee maker during a business trip in a hotel room? You know they don’t clean those things… Built for travel, this Premium Coffee Set comes conveniently packed in a black travel bag with a bonus cleaning brush. No messing with batteries or power cords. Simply grab your bag and go with the peace of mind that you can enjoy your brew anytime, anywhere. ★ OFFICE & HOME: Not the traveling type? No worries! This coffee set most definitely looks appealing in an office or home setting as well. Just leave it on any counter or desk to attract interesting looks directed your way.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510p4VjcJDL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CookinGadgets","source_asin":"B01M22XFLS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-414613","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M22XFLS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M22XFLS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
