window.products.push({"id":414996,"name":"Crenova Robot Vacuum Cleaner with Invisible Wall Fully Aucomatic Self-Charging Ultrasonic Obstacle and Duty Dection","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a3jE-7O4L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"You are too busy to vacuum your floors regularly, and yet you hate dirty floors. The Crenova robot vacuum is one of the best ways to keep your hard surfaces and carpets clean without having to do the cleaning yourself. 4-in-1 cleaning capability Simultaneous side brushes, a rolling brush sweeping, vacuuming, UV sterilizing and HEPA filtration help keep you and your family healthy. 5 cleaning modes Controlled by intelligent software and ultrasonic sensors, the Crenova vacuum cleaner creates a complete map of your home, including Auto, Spot, Wall Edges, Z-shaped, Polygonal cleaning path, this ensures an optimal clean. 1200pa powerful design for more efficient suction 1200pa powerful vacuum pulls dirt and hair off brushes into the large dustbin, its high suction power provides a deep and thorough clean. Automatically adjusts to all kinds of floor types Automatic height-adjustment capability easily and effectively vacuum bare floors, carpets and other surfaces. Not recommended for plush carpet or medium/long thread carpet. Block off designated areas The included virtual wall creates an ultrasonic line to section off parts of the room or delicate objects you want it to avoid. Obstacle and stair detection The numerous ultrasonic sensors keep Crenova robot cleaner from bumping into fruniture or falling done stairs. Low noise design The Crenova robot cleaner is relatively quiet at just 55 dB, which allows you to go about your business without feeling like your quiet time is being interrupted.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a3jE-7O4L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crenova","source_asin":"B01M7YW2C0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-414996","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M7YW2C0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M7YW2C0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
